# Review policy

How to review changes in this repository. It applies to every reviewer, human or AI.

## What matters in this repo

- Billing arithmetic in `src/billing/**`: totals, rounding, and tax rates.
- Money values never change representation silently.

## Raise to review even if small

- `src/billing/**` — every charge-path change, however small.
- `config/settings.py` — runtime settings and the legacy fallback.
- `.env*` files appearing in a diff at all.

## Block until a human looks

- Any secret, token, or credential committed anywhere in the repository.
- New outbound calls that send customer or billing data off the platform.

## Ignore

- Formatting and import order; never report whitespace.
- Comment and docstring rewording that changes no behaviour.

## Security expectations

- Credentials belong in the environment; never commit keys or `.env*` files.
- Never quote a secret value in a finding; cite the file and line only.

## Evidence and nits

- Every finding names the file and line and quotes the changed code (except secrets: cite the path only).
- At most 3 nits per PR.
